<title>USA: Boston Beer to launch cider line.</title>
<headline>Boston Beer to launch cider line.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boston Beer Co Inc said Wednesday it will introduce its first non-beer beverages, two kinds of hard cider drinks.</p>
<p>The makers of Samuel Adams beer, Boston Beer said the ciders will be called HardCore Crisp Hard Cider and HardCore Cranberry Cider.</p>
<p>The market for cider drinks has grown by 59 percent annually from 1990 to 1995 and from 1994 to 1995 grew by 162 percent, Boston Beer said.</p>
<p>((Boston bureau, (617) 367-4176))</p>
